  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Hanging Around**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Future On Up The Road**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Althea**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Whiskey In The Jar**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Cheap Tequila**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Cheap Sunglasses**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Brakedown**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Going Down The Road Feeling Bad**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-05-11.mg21flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 27 songs; 195 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- This was a late-night set that featured the Chris Jabocs Band [1]\n- Neal Casal of Circles Around The Sun is credited on guitar [1]\n- At the end the band leaves the stage while the drummer keeps playing a solo [1]\n- Billy Strings and Cris Jacobs shared a late-night Saturday set made up largely of covers at the South Carolina festival [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-05-11.mg21flac24**: taped by George Heston; transferred by George Heston; source: microtech gefell sms2000(body)>mg21(hypers) M148 > P2(oade mod acm 24/48) [1]",
